# SCRUM-388: the planner and propagator build from the repository root so they
# can COPY libs/aps_math. Without this file the whole repo becomes build context
# for those images, which is slow and ships things that have no business in a
# runtime image.
#
# SCRUM-447: the ui image now builds from the root too, for the same reason (the
# globe's shared propagator lives in libs/aps_math), so services/ui/ can no
# longer be excluded here. It is therefore in the context of the planner and
# propagator builds as well; that costs a little context transfer and ships
# nothing extra, because each Dockerfile COPYs only the paths it needs.

.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.claude
.claude

# Tests and fixtures are not runtime artefacts.
**/tests/
conftest.py
**/conftest.py

# Docs, deployment manifests and local tooling.
docs/
k8s/
demo/
scripts/
openapi/
*.md
docker-compose*.yaml

# Other services are not part of these images. services/ui/ is deliberately not
# listed: it is the build context for the ui image (SCRUM-447).
services/detector/
services/ingest/
services/physics-classifier/
services/sandbox/
services/tracker/
services/viz/
services/voice/
